<div id="data-panel" class="screen-panel" style="display:none;"><div class="confirm-copy">You can export your game data (saves, memory cards, settings, etc.) to a zip file. You can also import a previous export.</div><div class="confirm-actions"><button id="data-export" class="menu-action">EXPORT DATA</button><button id="data-import" class="menu-action">IMPORT DATA</button><button id="data-back" class="menu-action">BACK</button></div><div id="data-status" class="data-status"></div><div id="data-import-dialog" class="data-dialog" style="display:none;"><div class="data-dialog-title">ARE YOU SURE?</div><div id="data-import-message" class="data-dialog-copy"></div><div class="data-dialog-actions"><button id="data-import-cancel" class="menu-action">NO, KEEP MY EXISTING DATA</button><button id="data-import-confirm" class="menu-action">YES, IMPORT AND REPLACE MY DATA</button></div></div></div>
